#. <CLT 4>そうだ！　このモノクマが写るモニター！
#. ここに事件の手がかりが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's it! The monitor Monokuma always shows up on!\n"
"There's gotta be a clue here!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ある訳ない。捜査に集中しよう。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Or not. I'd better get back to the investigation."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As much as it gets on my nerves, I'd better leave it\n"
"alone.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>自販機だ…
#. これは、事件解決の手掛かりにはならないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A vending machine... I don't think it's going to help\n"
"me solve this case.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なにか、事件解決の手掛かりになるもの…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's gotta be something here to help with the\n"
"case...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ……ないか。
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Guess not."
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
